<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <div class="mb-8">
    <span class="text-xs bg-slate-800 text-brand-500 px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono"><%= article.evidenceLevel %></span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mt-4"><%= article.title %></h1>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500 border-b border-slate-800 pb-6">
      <span>Yazar: <%= article.author %></span>
      <span>Tarih: <%= article.date %></span>
      <span>Okuma Süresi: <%= article.readTime %></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 space-y-6">
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-semibold"><%= article.excerpt %></p>
    <p>Bu makalenin detaylı metodolojik analizi, deneysel verileri ve mekanik gerilim grafikleri haftalık bültende yayınlanmıştır.</p>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>